            "title": "Ninja Kitten Skateboarders",
            "summary": "I spent over 20 years with the mind of a skateboarder, every&hellip;",
            "content_html": "<div class=\"gallery-wrapper\"><div class=\"gallery\" data-is-empty=\"false\" data-translation=\"Add images\" data-columns=\"3\">\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/48/gallery/Qwen_Edit_2511_00475_.png\" data-size=\"1608x1208\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/48/gallery/Qwen_Edit_2511_00475_-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"577\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/48/gallery/20251106_111008.jpg\" data-size=\"4032x3024\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/48/gallery/20251106_111008-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"576\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/48/gallery/Qwen_Edit_2511_00469_.png\" data-size=\"1608x1208\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/48/gallery/Qwen_Edit_2511_00469_-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"577\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/48/gallery/Qwen_Edit_2511_00464_.png\" data-size=\"1608x1208\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/48/gallery/Qwen_Edit_2511_00464_-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"577\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/48/gallery/Qwen_Edit_2511_00451_.png\" data-size=\"1608x1208\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/48/gallery/Qwen_Edit_2511_00451_-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"577\"></a></figure>\n</div></div>\n<p>I spent over 20 years with the mind of a skateboarder, every place you go, you are looking for something to skate. I would still be searching for places to skate if healing from falls didn't take 10 times longer now : ) . I drew this a long time ago learning to draw the world around me. The first thing I thought when I saw this sketch, was a kitten ninja doing a trick going down the staircase, and naturally made the scene a bit funnier with some fun prompting.</p>",
